  "notes": "Murder Duels is a first-person dueling game from the Breakfast group that is still in beta. You step on a pad to start a match, from 1v1 up to 4v4, and every player gets both a knife and a revolver, each with its own special abilities. The first side to win five rounds takes the duel, and wins earn XP that raises your level and unlocks new knife and revolver skins.\n\nCodes mostly give free cases, which you open for cosmetic skins you can keep or trade with other players. The 100MOG code is the one to grab first, since its OG Knife is exclusive and cannot be unboxed from cases. New codes arrive almost every time the game passes another 10,000 likes, and they are posted in the Discord and on code trackers soon after.",
